{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2018-05", "window": 3, "start_date": 1526428800, "end_date": 1527119999, "month_true_total": 101, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:51:00 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "42190425", "author": {"steamid": "76561198265952466", "personaname": "potabara", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/xiaoyeshanji/", "num_games_owned": 397, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 10023, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3388, "last_played": 1663514673, "avatar": "fc5d8974fd3b0cd4519d382edd70e89172d6da5b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "不如尬舞\n挖矿石不如尬舞\n让自己觉得舒服\n是每个人的天赋\n继续尬舞\n打怪物不如尬舞\n用这个方式相处\n没有人觉得孤独\n也没有包袱\n你正在说着什么我很模糊\n只有好音乐让我听得清楚\n言语从这里开始失去作用\n只有节奏感能够互相接触", "timestamp_created": 1527064753, "timestamp_updated": 1527064753, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42180065", "author": {"steamid": "76561198401570639", "personaname": "バイゾーァさま", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198401570639/", "num_games_owned": 236, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 4899, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1179, "last_played": 1706881671, "avatar": "de7aed4299406a52b01b0fc087ec5eb1d380b7e7"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "可玩性非常高的一款游戏，你可以当成求生游戏也可以选工程师在定点取物里当成塔防模式。非常良心的一款游戏", "timestamp_created": 1527006360, "timestamp_updated": 1527006360, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42178738", "author": {"steamid": "76561198154761011", "personaname": "nihang0817", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198154761011/", "num_games_owned": 90, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 3056, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 869, "last_played": 1672218452, "avatar": "792fccb65f9a3c8b2b33633ba7cbbe3efca17c0d"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "游戏存档莫名其妙的没了，刷的等级和材料全没了，所有东西全部清零， 不止一次这样了，不想玩了 退款不给退 不建议入手", "timestamp_created": 1527001413, "timestamp_updated": 1527001413, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.498486369848251343", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42172691", "author": {"steamid": "76561198801078580", "personaname": "Aicek", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198801078580/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1137, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 335, "last_played": 1779781469, "avatar": "958b9bbeb0b5f9738566a5e1f4923103022ab6c9"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "游戏挺不错，要是能打打折什么的就更好了。还有多出几个地图", "timestamp_created": 1526972292, "timestamp_updated": 1526972292, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42165817", "author": {"steamid": "76561198316401827", "personaname": "uU@ `/$", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/diewithoutpain/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 156, "playtime_forever": 1081, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 888, "last_played": 1527698009, "avatar": "8df0701f74110d1e6aa505f1062168227e48b31e"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "自从玩了联机游戏，越来越能理解长辈们的麻将社交了。似乎社交这件事本身是没有任何实质的形式的，一定要依附于某件事情之上才能得以进行。当你想和好基友促进感情的时候，你会找他开黑、打球、吃饭…但如果你跟他说“你出来咱俩唠唠。”那得到的答复不是“咋的不服啊？”就是“对不起，我是直的。”\n\n这款（尚在开发中的）游戏的模式很简单，但很有趣。虽然有趣，但确实很简单。这种特性使得她很适合作为一个社交平台。多人模式的很大一部分乐趣来自于和好基友一边机械地挖矿一边扯皮。平时没什么时间刻意联系，一起游戏时对彼此近况的了解就和游戏里的矿石一样累积得越来越丰富。反过来说，和路人组队的体验就不是很好。大家都只顾各挖各的，甚至有一次虫群来袭把我包围住了，队友却已经不知道跑到哪去了……\n\n还有单人模式，带给我的收获更加另类。我之前被装逼的欲望冲昏了头脑，买了古典音乐入门的音频课，却一个礼拜也听不完一节。可是玩单人模式的时候，实在是太单调，就把背景音乐关掉，打开了音频课。结果做一个任务就听完了两节课！屏幕上“啊那有硝石！”耳机里“所谓残响就是…”屏幕上“啊黄金快去挖！”耳机里“李斯特的第一场钢琴独奏会…”……\n\n也许你觉得我是在吐槽，但其实我真心觉得这个游戏还挺有趣的。如果是我不喜欢的游戏，根本连玩都不会去玩。所以如果对这种题材和游戏模式感兴趣的话，还是可以一试的。\n\n说了这么多，最后总结其实就是一句话：矿骡就是个坑货，每次返回的时候都把我带到坑里！！", "timestamp_created": 1526933728, "timestamp_updated": 1526933728, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 39, "votes_funny": 14, "weighted_vote_score": "0.784751653671264648", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}